    "question": {
      ":question/id": "13040e65-b262-59d5-bb00-6c717327379c",
      ":question/problem": "Without using a calculator, find the exact value of\n\n$$\n4\\sin\\left(\\frac{225}{2}^{\\circ}\\right)\\cos\\left(\\frac{225}{2}^{\\circ}\\right)\n$$\n\n$$\n4\\sin\\left(\\frac{225}{2}^{\\circ}\\right)\\cos\\left(\\frac{225}{2}^{\\circ}\\right)=\n$$\n{{value}}",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Use the double-angle formula for sine and keep the multiplier.\n\nSet $x=\\frac{225}{2}^{\\circ}$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2\\sin x\\cos x &=\\sin(2x) \\\\ &=\\sin\\left(225^{\\circ}\\right) \\\\ &=- \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstitute this exact value:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4\\sin\\left(\\frac{225}{2}^{\\circ}\\right)\\cos\\left(\\frac{225}{2}^{\\circ}\\right)&=2\\left(- \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\right) \\\\ &=- \\sqrt{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/easy",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
